    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/5e0b7f6d75b8574a7566a5c3bc854853.avif?t=1750865685\" width=730 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deluge</strong> is a dark, story-rich RPG about memory, morality, and the undead. You play as a resurrected soldier bound to serve a tyrant who once destroyed your home. As Ganglim returns to crush the last remnants of resistance, you infiltrate a rebuilt village\u2014only to find yourself haunted by the life you left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Figaro, a place shaped by grief, art, and its fractured community. Engage in tense, turn-based battles against ghouls, demons, and twisted remnants of the past. Navigate branching decisions, a developing conscience, and meaningful choices that shape your role in a world trying desperately to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry out your orders, or remember who you were?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven RPG about memory, morality, and the undead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reanimated corpse serving the tyrant who destroyed your home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the grief-stricken village of Figaro, full of secrets and a hidden past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional turn-based combat, emphasizing strategy and experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions impact how the world sees you\u2014and how you see yourself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/6ff434d2a884f0c05e6303c4bb510bbf.avif?t=1750865685\" width=730 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer's note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Originally released on October 31, 2021, <strong>DELUGE</strong> was my first RPG Maker passion project. This upcoming reinvention of the original release upgrades every facet of the game and re-introduces the tale of Hudson, Ganglim and the village of Figaro with a variety of quality-of-life upgrades, enhanced storylines and an abundance of new content to uncover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/d3318eb24082d4f907ef2e992aeb254a.avif?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=212 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/5e0b7f6d75b8574a7566a5c3bc854853.avif?t=1750865685\" width=730 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deluge</strong> is a dark, story-rich RPG about memory, morality, and the undead. You play as a resurrected soldier bound to serve a tyrant who once destroyed your home. As Ganglim returns to crush the last remnants of resistance, you infiltrate a rebuilt village\u2014only to find yourself haunted by the life you left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Figaro, a place shaped by grief, art, and its fractured community. Engage in tense, turn-based battles against ghouls, demons, and twisted remnants of the past. Navigate branching decisions, a developing conscience, and meaningful choices that shape your role in a world trying desperately to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry out your orders, or remember who you were?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven RPG about memory, morality, and the undead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a reanimated corpse serving the tyrant who destroyed your home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the grief-stricken village of Figaro, full of secrets and a hidden past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional turn-based combat, emphasizing strategy and experimentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions impact how the world sees you\u2014and how you see yourself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/6ff434d2a884f0c05e6303c4bb510bbf.avif?t=1750865685\" width=730 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer's note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Originally released on October 31, 2021, <strong>DELUGE</strong> was my first RPG Maker passion project. This upcoming reinvention of the original release upgrades every facet of the game and re-introduces the tale of Hudson, Ganglim and the village of Figaro with a variety of quality-of-life upgrades, enhanced storylines and an abundance of new content to uncover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/d3318eb24082d4f907ef2e992aeb254a.avif?t=1750865685\" width=600 height=212 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Deluge is a brooding, story-driven RPG where you play as the resurrected antihero Hudson, a corpse tasked with infiltrating a battered community. Bound to a tyrant\u2019s will but haunted by your past, you must battle monsters and make choices that shape your path toward redemption... or lead it to ruin.",
